Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,That\Nstrange Bluetooth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,symbol\Nhides two letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:04.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two runes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,merged\Ninto one symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The name honours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,King\NHarald Bluetooth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:10.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,who united Denmark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and Norway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,At\Nan industry meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:13.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Intel's Jim Kardach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,suggested it as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:16.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,a\Ntemporary code name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:18.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Harald\Nunited Scandinavia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,This radio link
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:20.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,would unite PCs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:21.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:22.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,It was only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,a placeholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,RadioWire or PAN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,was meant to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,replace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,PAN was already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:29.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,everywhere online,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:31.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,and RadioWire's\Ntrademark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:31.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,check ran out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:32.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the logo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,merges\NHarald's initials
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:36.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,in runes:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,H and B.
